    "bio": "A Representative from Iowa; born in Storm Lake, Buena Vista County, Iowa, May 28, 1949; graduated from Denison Community High School, Denison, Iowa; attended Northwest Missouri State University, Maryville, Mo., 1967-1970; business owner; member of the Iowa state senate, 1996-2002; elected as a Republican to the One Hundred Eighth and to the eight succeeding Congresses (January 3, 2003-January 3, 2021); unsuccessful candidate for nomination to the One Hundred Seventeenth Congress in 2020.&nbsp;",
